title: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Initial authorization
route: /authorizations/new/:draftId (Intake, type 'Initial authorization')
intro: Intake is patient onboarding. One row of ways in sits at the top (Pull from EMR, Import a file, Paste a screenshot, Referrals, Known patient), then one form: Patient, Coverage, Request and a folded More. Everything stays editable and nothing here stops the person from going on: what is missing is listed on Review & submit. A possible duplicate is the one alert Intake raises.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Open Intake on an initial authorization\nA new case, a referral continued into it, a known patient picked, or ?verification="
screen sc "Intake · Initial authorization\nThe row of ways in, then the form\nNo sentence under the title"
group gWays "The row of ways in"
  click cImp "Click 'Pull from EMR', 'Import a file' or 'Paste a screenshot'\nor press Ctrl+V or Cmd+V in the row"
  click cRefs "Click 'Referrals' (count of open referrals)"
  click cKnown "Click 'Known patient'"
endgroup
goto gImp "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient"
screen sFrom "Once a referral or a known patient is in, one line under the row\n'From referral RF-2051 · St. Brigid Medical Center' or 'Existing patient R-1042'\nand 'Use a different referral' or 'Use a different patient'"
click cRef "Click the referral number in the line"
goto gRef "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Referral › The full referral page"
process pPay "A case Payers redrafted after a payer change shows one line\n'Updated for a payer change on 10/20'"
screen sDup "One alert at a time\n'This looks like a request that already exists' (only when one matches)"
goto gDup "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Possible duplicate"

group gForm "The form, one card"
  screen f1 "Patient\nInitials, Date of birth with Age beside it, Sex"
  screen f2 "Coverage\nPayer, Plan type (the payer's own plans), Member ID"
  screen f3 "Request\nLevel of care, Request type (Initial request or Admission), Requested start date\nPrimary diagnosis (ICD-10), Site"
  screen f4 "More, folded\nSecondary insurance, Requested end date, Attending clinician and NPI, Referral source\nGuardian, only for a patient under 18"
endgroup
goto gRows "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Intake › Patient, insurance and request rows"
goto gSite "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Sites and scope"

group gFoot "Bar at the bottom, always in view"
  screen ft "'Save as draft' and 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits'"
  toast h1 "A payer workflow warning, when there is one\n'Workflow: ...'"
endgroup
click cSave "Click 'Save as draft'"
toast tSave "'Draft saved'\n'R-1701 is in Case Manager.'"
goto gSave "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Save as draft and leave"
click cCont "Click 'Continue to Eligibility & Benefits'"
process pGo "Moves to step 2\nNothing blocks the click"
goto gElig "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case › Eligibility & Benefits › Initial authorization"

s1 --> sc
sc --> cImp --> gImp
sc --> cRefs --> gImp
sc --> cKnown --> gImp
sc --> sFrom
sFrom --> cRef --> gRef
sc --> pPay
sc --> sDup -.-> gDup
sc --> f1 & f2 & f3 & f4
f1 --> gRows
f2 --> gRows
f3 --> gRows
f3 -.-> gSite
f4 -.-> gRows
sc --> ft
ft -.-> h1
ft --> cSave --> tSave --> gSave
ft --> cCont --> pGo --> gElig
